@startuml CreatePost_Sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant AppServer
participant DB
participant FileSystem

' Factory + Service(Facade) + Repository 흐름
User -> Browser: fills add-post form (title, brand/model, images)
Browser -> AppServer: POST /add (form data + images)
AppServer -> ConcretePostFactory: create("InstrumentPost", data)
ConcretePostFactory --> AppServer: InstrumentPost(instance)
AppServer -> PostService: createPost(instrumentPost)
PostService -> PostRepository: save(instrumentPost)
PostRepository -> DB: if brand==custom INSERT BrandInfo else use brand_id
DB --> PostRepository: brand_id / post id
PostRepository --> PostService: saved post
PostService -> FileSystem: save uploaded images -> filenames
FileSystem --> PostService: filenames
PostService -> PostRepository: update images
PostService --> Browser: redirect / (or post page)

@enduml
